  "contentHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/215\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/215</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/215\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=424t&amp;datanum=215\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/215\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/215\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(null)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>위 글을 참고하여 2학년 달 수업 후 중간고사 이후에 막간을 이용하여 활동해 보았습니다.</p><p>저는 긴 글 지도는 자신이 없어서.... 짧은 글로 부탁했습니다.(과학쌤의 손가락, 발가락을 오그라뜨려라가 미션이다. 오글오글한 글 좋다, 중2병이란 무엇인가 본때를 보여준다는 마음으로.. SNS적 감성으로 가달라고 했는데.. 애들이 금손이네요...)</p><p>준비물 : A4(검은색, 처음에는 큰 걸로 하려다 절반 잘랐습니다.) 종이, 은색 펜, 금색 펜, 흰색 색연필, 가위, 풀, 달 사진(부드러운 느낌, 거친 느낌의 흑백 사진 두종류와 약간 레드문 느낌이 나도록 조절한 사진 세종류 준비했습니다), 소독용품(소독제, 소독티슈 등)</p><p>조건 1. 달이 있어야 한다.(잘라도 됨, 삭은 안됨)</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;2. 짧은 글 필수(안되면 노래 가사도 좋음)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>조금 더 과학적으로 접근하려고 하는 의도였다면 과학적 사실이나 그런 것들은 반영할 수 있도록 조건을 더 제시해야 하겠습니다. ㅜㅜ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/161bffab2b21031a3892cae597d4f90d756722af\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/161bffab2b21031a3892cae597d4f90d756722af\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3fc074571922e34c03e2f9e1cbcfa2d55bb0adfb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3fc074571922e34c03e2f9e1cbcfa2d55bb0adfb\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/27cf6dd7f105324168ec0ec79053cabbdb08daeb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/27cf6dd7f105324168ec0ec79053cabbdb08daeb\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0177101c14af591fdc3537f0361a749562269cfa\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0177101c14af591fdc3537f0361a749562269cfa\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4b16874505395e4b8f0c2d966d191aedc2328624\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4b16874505395e4b8f0c2d966d191aedc2328624\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eacba5de759c4cfd1e66aff48cfb72f2932d6838\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eacba5de759c4cfd1e66aff48cfb72f2932d6838\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/66436a7ca84295b5404ef45923fd9c18680c1c74\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/c